WEBVTT

00:00:59.138 --> 00:01:01.224
We will live, work and play together,

00:01:01.265 --> 00:01:04.185
building a whole new,
magical dimension of existence.

00:01:04.185 --> 00:01:06.145
(Laughter)

00:01:06.187 --> 00:01:07.647
It sounds like a dream, right?

00:01:07.647 --> 00:01:10.399
Well, technically,
it’s a programmer’s nightmare.

00:01:10.399 --> 00:01:12.819
But if we can pull it off,

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.656
it will become the world's
largest community-driven

00:01:16.656 --> 00:01:19.909
digital world-building experiment to date.

00:01:21.327 --> 00:01:26.374
But we don't want to sit inside
staring at our screens anymore.

00:01:26.415 --> 00:01:27.625
At least I don't.

00:01:27.667 --> 00:01:29.127
I love my digital art,

00:01:29.168 --> 00:01:31.879
but I want to take it with me
out into the real world.